    "final_answer": "I have gathered comprehensive information about destinations from Seattle on Google Flights. Let me provide the final recommendations.\n\n## Task Complete: Famous Destinations from Seattle\n\nI successfully navigated to Google Flights, set the origin to **Seattle (西雅图)**, and viewed the destinations on the map. Here's a summary of my findings:\n\n### 🗺️ Destinations on the Map (Seattle departure)\n\nGoogle Flights displayed many destinations across North America with prices and flight details. The map showed pins for various destinations with their flight information. Below are the **famous places within reasonable distance and price** from Seattle:\n\n### ⭐ Top Recommendations (Reasonable Distance & Price)\n\n| Rank | Destination | Price | Flight Time | Airline | Notes |\n|------|-------------|-------|-------------|---------|-------|\n| 🥇 | **Los Angeles (洛杉矶)** | **$92** | 2h 50m (direct) | Frontier Airlines | Hollywood, beaches, Disneyland, Griffith Observatory |\n| 🥈 | **Las Vegas (拉斯维加斯)** | **$134** | 2h 46m (1 stop) | Frontier Airlines | The Strip, casinos, world-class entertainment |\n| 🥉 | **San Francisco (旧金山)** | **$157** | 2h 10m (direct) | Alaska Airlines | Golden Gate Bridge, Alcatraz, Fisherman's Wharf |\n| 4 | **San Diego (圣迭戈)** | **$157** | 2h 55m (direct) | Southwest Airlines | Beaches, San Diego Zoo, Balboa Park |\n| 5 | **Portland (波特兰)** | **$217** | 57 min (direct) | Alaska Airlines | Food trucks, coffee culture, Mt. Hood |\n| 6 | **Denver (丹佛)** | **$204** | 2h 50m (1 stop) | Frontier Airlines | Rocky Mountains gateway, skiing |\n| 7 | **Chicago (芝加哥)** | **$229** | 5h 57m (1 stop) | Frontier Airlines | Architecture, deep-dish pizza, Millennium Park |\n| 8 | **Salt Lake City (盐湖城)** | **$257** | 1 stop | — | Ski resorts, national parks gateway |\n| 9 | **Austin (奥斯汀)** | **$277** | 4h 10m (1 stop) | Frontier + Southwest | Live music capital, BBQ, tech scene |\n| 10 | **Miami (迈阿密)** | **$387** | 7h 21m (1 stop) | American Airlines | South Beach, Art Deco, Everglades |\n\n### 💡 Best Value Picks (Famous + Cheap + Short Flight)\n\nFor travelers looking for the **best balance of fame, distance, and price** from Seattle:\n\n1. **Los Angeles – $92** — Best deal! Famous worldwide for Hollywood, Venice Beach, and Disneyland. Direct flight under 3 hours.\n2. **San Francisco – $157** — Iconic Golden Gate Bridge, Alcatraz, and cable cars. Only 2h 10m direct.\n3. **San Diego – $157** — Beautiful beaches, the world-famous San Diego Zoo, and perfect weather. 2h 55m direct.\n4. **Las Vegas – $134** — The Entertainment Capital of the World. Great for a quick getaway.\n\nThese destinations offer a mix of iconic sightseeing, short flight times, and affordable prices (mostly under $200), making them ideal choices from Seattle.",
